{"step_index":211,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:48:20Z","thinking":"**Integrating Character Sprites**\n\nOkay, I'm currently focused on incorporating the character sprites into `index.html`. I'm working on integrating the visuals for the parent prompt banner and the level 1 Bé Bin stage. I've also added the officer avatar for level 3, updating the HTML structure to accommodate all the new graphic assets.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"vi\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=3.0, user-scalable=yes, viewport-fit=cover\">\n    <title>Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay (Parent-Co-Play Interactive Book)</title>\n    <!-- Offline font fallback stack & Google Font -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@700;800;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"app-root\">\n        <!-- Canvas Pháo hoa, Sao lấp lánh & Trái tim -->\n        <canvas id=\"effects-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- TOP BAR: 8 LEVEL DOTS & CỔNG BA MẸ -->\n        <header class=\"top-nav\">\n            <nav class=\"stage-indicators\" aria-label=\"Tiến trình chuyến bay\">\n                <button class=\"stage-dot active\" data-screen=\"1\" aria-label=\"Level 1: Mặc đồ\">👕</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"2\" aria-label=\"Level 2: Xếp vali\">🧳</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"3\" aria-label=\"Level 3: Kiểm tra an ninh\">🎫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"4\" aria-label=\"Level 4: Tìm Cổng Bay\">🚪</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"5\" aria-label=\"Level 5: Hiệp sĩ đai\">🦸</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"6\" aria-label=\"Level 6: Ngắm mây\">☁️</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"7\" aria-label=\"Level 7: Lịch sự\">🤫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"8\" aria-label=\"Level 8: Nhận vali & Thưởng\">🏆</button>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây) -->\n            <button id=\"btn-parent-gate\" class=\"tycoon-btn parent-gate-btn\" aria-label=\"Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây)\">\n                <svg class=\"parent-hold-ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n                    <circle id=\"parent-ring-circle\" cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"26\"></circle>\n                </svg>\n                ⚙️ <span>Ba Mẹ</span>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- BIỂN BÁO LỜI THOẠI BA MẸ ĐỌC (PARENT PROMPT BANNER VỚI AVATAR NHÂN VẬT GỐC) -->\n        <div class=\"parent-prompt-container\">\n            <div class=\"parent-prompt-signboard\">\n                <div id=\"parent-prompt-avatar\" class=\"prompt-avatar-sprite speaker-mom\"></div>\n                <span id=\"parent-prompt-text\" class=\"prompt-speech-text\">“Bin sắp đi máy bay rồi. Con chọn bộ đồ nào giúp Bin dễ vận động nhé!”</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- VIEWPORT 8 MÀN CHƠI CHÍNH -->\n        <main class=\"screens-viewport\">\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 1: TRANG PHỤC THOẢI MÁI (GOLDEN SAMPLE VISUAL 100% ARTWORK)\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-1\" class=\"screen active\">\n                <div class=\"wardrobe-arena\">\n                    <!-- Tủ quần áo chứa 6 món đồ Artwork 3D -->\n                    <div class=\"wardrobe-cabinet-art\">\n                        <!-- 1. Áo thun mềm (Soft) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"shirt\" aria-label=\"Áo thun mềm\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/shirt_soft_1787719072757.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Áo thun mềm\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Áo thun êm</span>\n                        </button>\n                        \n                        <!-- 2. Quần bò cứng (Stiff) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"jeans\" aria-label=\"Quần bò cứng\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/jeans_stiff_1787719123153.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Quần bò cứng\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Quần bò cứng</span>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- 3. Quần thun co giãn (Soft) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"pants\" aria-label=\"Quần thun co giãn\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/pants_soft_1787719157043.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Quần thun co giãn\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Quần thun êm</span>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- 4. Bộ liền rườm rà (Stiff) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"dress\" aria-label=\"Bộ liền rườm rà\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/outfit_onepiece_1787719198691.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Bộ liền rườm rà\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Bộ yếm rườm rà</span>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- 5. Giày dán xé (Soft) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"shoes\" aria-label=\"Giày dán xé\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/shoes_velcro_1787719241323.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Giày dán xé\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Giày dán tiện</span>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- 6. Giày nhiều dây (Stiff) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"boots\" aria-label=\"Giày nhiều dây\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/boots_laces_1787719296706.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Giày nhiều dây\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Giày nhiều dây</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Nhân vật Bé Bin 3D Chuẩn Thiết Kế Gốc -->\n                    <div class=\"bin-character-stage\">\n                        <div id=\"bin-dress-target\" class=\"bin-stage-pedestal\">\n                            <div id=\"bin-main-sprite\" class=\"bin-sprite-crop\"></div>\n                            \n                            <!-- Các huy hiệu trang phục đã chọn thành công -->\n                            <div class=\"dressed-badges-overlay\">\n                                <div id=\"bin-slot-shirt\" class=\"dress-check-badge\">Áo ⏳</div>\n                                <div id=\"bin-slot-pants\" class=\"dress-check-badge\">Quần ⏳</div>\n                                <div id=\"bin-slot-shoes\" class=\"dress-check-badge\">Giày ⏳</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-1\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px; z-index: 50;\">\n                    Đi Xếp Vali Nào! 🧳 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 2: CHIẾC VALI KỲ DIỆU\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-2\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"suitcase-arena\">\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Gấu bông\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/teddy_bear_1787718486091.jpg\" style=\"width: 48px; height: 48px; object-fit: contain;\" class=\"item-icon\" alt=\"Gấu bông\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Gấu bông</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Quần áo\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/shirt_soft_1787719072757.jpg\" style=\"width: 48px; height: 48px; object-fit: contain;\" class=\"item-icon\" alt=\"Quần áo\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Quần áo</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"LEAVE_HOME\" aria-label=\"Kéo nhọn\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">✂️</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Kéo nhọn</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"suitcase-target-lvl2\" class=\"suitcase-box-red\" style=\"background-image: url('file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/red_suitcase_1787718454138.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;\">\n                        <div id=\"suitcase-inner-lvl2\" class=\"suitcase-inner-grid\" style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Bàn chải\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">🪥</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Bàn chải</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"ASK_PARENT\" aria-label=\"Bình nước lớn\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">🍼</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Bình lớn</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Mũ che nắng\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👒</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Mũ che nắng</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn